// samples the ball's position once per step; at level 6 a stuttered frame
// (DT_MAX = 50 ms) moves the ball 35.5 px, more than the 34 px window
// (BRICK_H + 2 * BALL_R) a brick needs to be crossed without ever being
// overlapped — the ball would jump clean over it (tunnelling, #1). Capping
